{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20342","headline":"怀别 · 张籍","name":"怀别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仆人驱行轩，低昂出我门。\n离堂无留客，席上唯琴樽。\n古道随水曲，悠悠绕荒村。\n远程未奄息，别念在朝昏。\n端居愁岁永，独此留清景。\n岂无经过人，寻叹门巷静。\n君如天上雨，我如屋下井。\n无因同波流，愿作形与影。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}